{"id":68890,"date":"2025-10-05T07:50:24","date_gmt":"2025-10-05T06:50:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68890"},"modified":"2026-09-28T20:50:09","modified_gmt":"2026-09-28T19:50:09","slug":"maratona-de-sidney","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-sidney\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Sidney 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Sidney 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Sidney 2027<\/strong> (TCS Sydney Marathon presented by ASICS) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>29 de agosto de 2027<\/strong>, na vibrante metr\u00f3pole de <strong>Sidney<\/strong>, na Austr\u00e1lia. Integrando a elite das prestigiadas Abbott World Marathon Majors, a prova posiciona-se como o maior e mais emblem\u00e1tico evento desportivo de resist\u00eancia do continente oce\u00e2nico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O trajeto homologado de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> arranca em Bradfield Park com a inesquec\u00edvel travessia pedonal da Sydney Harbour Bridge, serpenteando por Darling Harbour, Centennial Park e pelo centro financeiro at\u00e9 \u00e0 apote\u00f3tica linha de meta instalada na esplanada da Sydney Opera House. Em simult\u00e2neo, disputa-se a cl\u00e1ssica Bridge Run de 10 km.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 uma coorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Athletics Australia<\/strong> e da <strong>Pont3<\/strong>, com o selo World Athletics Platinum Label, garantindo cronometragem por chip, m\u00faltiplos pontos de anima\u00e7\u00e3o, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e a cobi\u00e7ada medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Agosto de 2027<\/span><\/li>\